{"duration": 24.58, "cues": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 4.52, "text": "Taking only the liver may also\nprotect the orca's teeth. Shark skin"}, {"start": 4.52, "end": 9.62, "text": "is covered in tiny scales shaped like\nteeth, and it feels like sandpaper."}, {"start": 9.62, "end": 12.73, "text": "Orcas that eat a lot of shark\nwear their teeth down flat."}, {"start": 13.43, "end": 18.33, "text": "Since 1969, three dead orcas with\nflat-worn teeth and shark remains"}, {"start": 18.33, "end": 22.41, "text": "in their stomachs have washed up\nin South Africa. Port and Starboard"}, {"start": 22.41, "end": 24.58, "text": "seem to belong to this shark-eating type."}], "words": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 0.28, "text": "Taking"}, {"start": 0.28, "end": 0.6, "text": "only"}, {"start": 0.6, "end": 0.76, "text": "the"}, {"start": 0.76, "end": 1.04, "text": "liver"}, {"start": 1.04, "end": 1.22, "text": "may"}, {"start": 1.22, "end": 1.56, "text": "also"}, {"start": 1.56, "end": 1.96, "text": "protect"}, {"start": 1.96, "end": 2.16, "text": "the"}, {"start": 2.16, "end": 2.52, "text": "orca's"}, {"start": 2.52, "end": 2.8, "text": "teeth."}, {"start": 3.86, "end": 4.22, "text": "Shark"}, {"start": 4.22, "end": 4.52, "text": "skin"}, {"start": 4.52, "end": 4.68, "text": "is"}, {"start": 4.68, "end": 4.96, "text": "covered"}, {"start": 4.96, "end": 5.2, "text": "in"}, {"start": 5.2, "end": 5.5, "text": "tiny"}, {"start": 5.5, "end": 5.94, "text": "scales"}, {"start": 5.94, "end": 6.24, "text": "shaped"}, {"start": 6.24, "end": 6.5, "text": "like"}, {"start": 6.5, "end": 6.86, "text": "teeth,"}, {"start": 6.86, "end": 7.28, "text": "and"}, {"start": 7.28, "end": 7.4, "text": "it"}, {"start": 7.4, "end": 7.62, "text": "feels"}, {"start": 7.62, "end": 7.96, "text": "like"}, {"start": 7.96, "end": 8.84, "text": "sandpaper."}, {"start": 9.62, "end": 9.86, "text": "Orcas"}, {"start": 9.86, "end": 10.04, "text": "that"}, {"start": 10.04, "end": 10.28, "text": "eat"}, {"start": 10.28, "end": 10.4